  "details": "If I want to download and show an avatar I should be able to do so without bypassing the safety settings.\nRight now it is an all or nothing situation. You can not show an avatar but still have the safety settings enabled and you can not show an avatar while still using the performance settings. \nNot only has the community requested that individual safety settings need bypass options on a per user basis, but now I request the separation of the performance and safety settings when wanting to show an avatar.\n\nPerhaps a compromise could be the ability to temporary bypasses the individual settings. Say I want to download an avatar to see it, then just shove it in my temp folder and delete it when I leave the instance. Say I want to show an avatars animations, then just revert when either I or the user leaves the instance.",
